  "reason": "Existing evidence shows RNA-only models with scvi_n200 encoder (0.650 accuracy) outperform others, but uncertainty remains about image data utility. This experiment tests image-only with resnet50 to isolate image modality's impact, addressing key uncertainty about whether image data alone could surpass RNA-only performance. It directly compares singleprofile image-only to RNA-only baselines, clarifying if image modality is a critical factor without complicating with fusion or multimodal interactions."
